{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"美國西南部多個州水浸\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/US-FLOOD-261103-17.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】美國西南部連日暴雨，多個州水浸，至少一人死亡。</p><p>在亞利桑那州，高空片段拍攝到洪水淹浸民居，部分房屋及車輛露出水面。科羅拉多州的格蘭德河河水氾濫，州內另一條河聖胡安河水位高達5.1米，接近歷史高位。</p><p>洪水摧毀多棟房屋，有汽車四輪朝天，多個低窪地區水浸，數以百計居民緊急疏散。當地救援部門加緊救援，預料善後及清理工作長達多個星期。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T10:22:19.460162+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":1,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T09:18:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T09:38:24.202884+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T10:18:58.970143+00:00","content_hash":"cf52805ccbdc955dba0ec1a279d7123e77415364c75b6de560f99ee183ca8c2b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T10:22:19.460162+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}